  "details": "Allowing users to change the memory budget would allow for several things:\n\n1. better control over the vram that vrchat uses, one use case would be having vrchat open alongside unity.\n\n2. for creators, changing the budget would allow testing worlds with a lower budget, so we could \"emulate having less budget\", to see how it affects the world and avatars.",
